00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.700
He was here a moment ago.

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.400
What's going on?

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.080
Oh, nothing.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.740
He just came to check on me.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:18.490
Listen, we've been looking for Toot.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:19.730
So?

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.740
Everything is fine, I swear.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:24.480
As far as I know, he has no chance of my safety.

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:24.820
Never.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:27.540
So...

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:33.440
If you want a parrot, come on, pick whatever you want.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:41.940
I'm angry with you, but his mood is fixed.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:43.280
Oh, no problem.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:45.790
Listen, let's gather the parrot with us.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.210
Please, don't bother yourself.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:49.320
You don't have to be polite.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.760
What do you think of a little of this?

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.400
Oh, it looks delicious.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.960
His habit is to use the parrot in the forest.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:11:59.980
I'll give a little to the...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.700
Oh, thank you.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:11.610
Hello, Ash.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.780
But where were you, Sunny?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.100
I saw a Pokemon tower, so I followed it.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.600
Amazing. That lady was very nice.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:22.060
Here you go. Look, she gave us all this.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.120
Yummy. Bread with nuts.

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:26.530
One for each of us. Let's eat.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.970
Thank you, Ash. But I think I...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.480
I ate a lot for breakfast

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:33.340
Why don't you eat it?

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:43.600
It has a very beautiful sky

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.220
Yes, the weather is great

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:47.540
How is the bread?

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:48.660
It is the best

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.270
Don't you want a piece?

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:53.130
I look at you eating this bread

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.870
I feel like I'm sharing your food

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.940
I feel like I'm full

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:57.500
Really?

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.760
Wow, when I see someone

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.060
When they don't eat, I feel even more hungry

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.610
When you always eat what you want and suddenly everything changes

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.580
Don't you want to eat more?

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:14.840
Are you asking me? I want to eat my mother's Kaaki now

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.410
Yes, absolutely

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:21.600
I got it, we'll share this

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:28.970
This is amazing, you understand well what Pokemon says

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:31.870
I don't know what it feels like

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.530
I'm going to ask you for a favor

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:34.330
Huh?

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:50.060
That cup? But did you take it, Mank?

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:54.410
Yes, it's important to me. It's from my father

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:57.250
Yes, Mank took my cup today

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.930
Okay, I'll take care of it

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:03.000
I want you to help me with this, but the thing is...

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:11.030
I will find a solution.

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:15.960
Shut up, Liza. Give it to me.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.500
This cup is for his second friend, so I'll take it.

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:08.660
Do you like it to this extent?

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:11.740
Okay then, I'll give you my cups.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:12.080
Deal?

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:34.340
Hmm? Hey, wait! The cup!

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.940
Huh? Huh?

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:41.230
Yes

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:00.220
What is this?

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:01.360
Nothing

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.580
We are going to Nusa, do you want to join us?

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:08.350
A cup?

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.490
What cup?

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:14.040
Tell us, where and how did you get this cup?

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:18.190
Listen, I got it from Manki

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.850
Sani asked me for it

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:20.370
Really?

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:21.810
Don't lie

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:24.140
I don't lie at all

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:27.030
Hello, so you don't know Sani either?

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:29.560
We know her, of course we know her

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.390
He is the same

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:48.060
So he was sick for a year?

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:50.820
Yes, a year ago

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:52.670
But I saw him

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:07.630
When he was little, he used to run and play in the forest.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:11.880
He used to cover him while he played with the Pokemons.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:16.060
When I grow up, I will be a Pokemon trainer.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:19.180
I will catch a lot of them and take them to several battles.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:23.100
The sky was burning.

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:29.550
When he left us, my husband no longer drew anything but the sky.

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:34.170
He told me that it's his favorite sky

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:44.840
That it's his favorite

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.570
I remember this very well

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:52.490
You were working in the city while my husband was still drawing here

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.590
We were almost in touch

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:59.970
But on that day, when we finally got in touch and saw the...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.440
Like the sky

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:06.720
And after Sonny left us

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.200
We realized something important

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.270
The things we gave her

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.110
Will become more important after losing her

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.990
But we were very happy

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:20.140
And the things we assumed she would keep with us

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:24.450
Are now things that are possible for her

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:42.310
I will not only draw the sky, but also the forest and the Pokemon that Sunny loves.

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:11.250
Hi, Sunny

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.670
What's up?

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:18.460
I have an idea, you're holding a Pokemon

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.380
What if I didn't do it?

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:21.740
Don't say that

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:22.610
Here you go

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:22.930
Pikachu

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.010
I can't touch it

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.330
Stay still

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:49.680
Yes, and you too

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:53.260
But now, put your hand on mine

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.310
Like this?

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:12.510
He came just like you told me. He is gentle and warm. And doing this makes you very happy, you know. Thank you, Ash.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:29.270
I will be a Pokemon trainer. I will catch a lot of them and take several battles.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:56.980
These are the things we can do

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:01.960
I'm really happy for you, my friend.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.550
Peek-a-joo!

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:12.870
They arrived with him because of an emergency.

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:15.970
And this time, in a faraway place.

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:17.620
I didn't see his vision.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:18.880
But what about the work?

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.060
We'll see him next time, okay?

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.160
Peek-a-boo!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.730
I'll give you this.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:26.310
That's great!

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.800
I got a cup of tea.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:38.710
Listen, little one, I'll go to the kitchen of the Pokemon Center and prepare the food for you.

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:42.400
Here you go.

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:45.340
Thank you very much, mom.

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:50.840
You're welcome.

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:03.440
Here you go. Do you want some? I've already given you a lot of them.

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:05.420
I'll also bring you some sweets.

00:22:10.710 --> 00:22:19.770
I only ate one.

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:31.140
Breakfast!

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:52.060
You're so annoying!

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:54.380
And all of a sudden, everyone wants to get caught!

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:55.480
I'll stay here!

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:58.250
Alright then, eat this!

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:02.350
Thank you, mom. Goodbye.

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:16.480
The dog is a good dog.

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.230
Thank you for the food.

00:23:19.900 --> 00:23:21.320
Thank you. It's delicious.

00:23:21.780 --> 00:23:29.700
This boy is...

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:31.650
from the city of Palette

00:23:31.650 --> 00:23:33.350
to the side of Pikachu

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:36.110
focusing on facing the Pokemon

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:37.370
and catching them

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:43.530
The world of Pokemon is expanding

00:23:43.530 --> 00:23:45.310
widely and very far

00:23:45.310 --> 00:23:47.550
and Ash's journey will continue

00:23:47.550 --> 00:23:49.630
and continue, remember this
